1
00:00:00,313 --> 00:00:01,773
(Leonard:)What?

2
00:00:01,939 --> 00:00:05,399
(Sheldon:)Evolution has made women sensitive
to high-pitch noises while they sleep...

3
00:00:05,568 --> 00:00:07,698
(Sheldon:)...so that they'll be roused
by a crying baby.

4
00:00:07,862 --> 00:00:11,952
(Sheldon:)If you want to avoid waking her,
speak in a lower register.

5
00:00:12,950 --> 00:00:14,200
That's ridiculous!

6
00:00:14,368 --> 00:00:16,198
[PENNY SNORES]

7
00:00:17,622 --> 00:00:22,042
[IN DEEP VOICE]
No, that's ridiculous.

8
00:00:24,462 --> 00:00:26,252
[IN DEEP VOICE]
Fine.

9
00:00:27,548 --> 00:00:30,338
(Leonard(doing likewise):)I accept your premise.
Now, please let's go.

10
00:00:30,509 --> 00:00:33,509
- I'm not leaving until I'm done.
- Oh, no.

11
00:00:37,058 --> 00:00:40,848
(Sheldon:)If you have time to lean,
you have time to clean.

12
00:00:44,106 --> 00:00:46,316
(Leonard:)Oh, what the hell.

13
00:00:49,904 --> 00:00:51,984
[HUMMING]

14
00:00:53,699 --> 00:00:55,119
Good morning.

15
00:00:55,284 --> 00:00:56,864
(Scene:)Morning.

16
00:00:57,036 --> 00:01:00,376
(Sheldon:)I have to say I slept splendidly.

